  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-UNESCO - Silk Roads Heritage Corridors in Central Asia &#xbf; International Dimension of the European Year of Cultural Heritage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the long-term, the action will strengthen the contribution of culture to sustainable development, notably through heritage-based tourism development, diversifying tourism products and delivering high-quality visitor experiences along the Silk Roads heritage corridors in the participating countries. These activities aim to contribute to improving livelihoods of the communities in the region, including youth and women, through capacity-building and the creation of opportunities for income-generation and jobs.</narrative>
  </description>
